; Test fixtures for bcr.cli. Six records covering the cases the script must handle.
;
; mabA_* are the published trastuzumab V regions, already clean.
; mabB_VH is the same VH with a heavy-chain leader prepended and IgG1 CH1 running on.
; mabC_VL is synthetic: germline IGLV1 frameworks + IGLJ7 FR4, with a lambda
;   leader and IGLC2 constant region attached. Built to exercise the lambda path.
; mabD_VH is deliberately mislabelled — the sequence is a kappa light chain.
; mabE_VH is deliberately not an antibody (a GFP fragment).

